<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade Communications.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial Group analyst Michael Karfopoulos said he lowered his short-term rating on Cascade Communications Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said his long-term rating remains buy.</p>
<p>-- said his earnings estimate for fiscal 1997 remains unchanged at $1.10 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a fiscal 1998 estimate of $1.80 a share.</p>
<p>-- Cascade was off 21-1/8 to 43.</p>
</text>
